:''Not to be confused with [[Kaworu Cat (Rare Cat)]].''
'''Kaworu & Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] obtained as a Stamp Reward during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 6.10 increases range and gains area attack, but has a slightly slower attack rate.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 405
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Kaworu & Cat
|name2 = Plug Suit Kaworu
|name3 = Moon Kaworu
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Plug Suit Kaworu''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Moon Kaworu''' when obtained from [[The 10th Angel Strikes!]] (may be dropped on the first stage but guaranteed on the second stage) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
There is little use for Kaworu & Cat due to his overall low stats, with there being much better units that have the same niche like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] or [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Assassin BearCat]]. Due to this, his only relevant use is his [[Cat Combo]], which boosts the [[EVA Angel Killer]] ability to deal '''x25''' damage and take '''1/25''' damage from [[:Category:EVA Angel Enemies|EVA Angels]].

{{Job|Classification = Melee & Combo Slave|TrueClass = Midranger & Combo Slave|UltraClass=}}

